  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "A new gold contender, a higher hurdle",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "wire-2026-10-15-0005-arc-2-ibyyue-surges-into-gold",
        "wire-2026-10-15-0359-arc-2-gold-line-rises-to-5417"
      ],
      "text": "ibyyue’s overnight score event, from 43.89 to 56.81, carried the entry to 12th and into the 15 provisional gold places. The midnight wire had already reported the breakthrough; the morning consequence is a higher hurdle for the teams behind. Gold now requires 54.17, up from 53.06 at the baseline. masspeaks is 16th at an unchanged 53.06, immediately outside the band."
    },
    {
      "heading": "shiiin9 gains, but gold stays out of reach",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board"
      ],
      "text": "大阪公立大学 shiiin9 added 6.25 points against the edition baseline to reach 52.08 and close 17th. That is a substantial advance, but still just over two points below the gold cutoff. Khaotic Sethesis also improved, reaching 50.14, yet slipped two places in the edition comparison to 18th. A higher score alone is not enough when the field is moving too."
    },
    {
      "heading": "The top order shifts below the leaders",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "person-dries-smit-identity-0",
        "person-yi-chia-chen-identity-0"
      ],
      "text": "Tufa Labs holds first at 88.06, Yi-Chia Chen second at 83.89 and rabbithole third at 80.56. Their scores are unchanged, as is fourth-place nvbanana’s 77.08. Lower in the top ten, Domdolus Tolus recorded a rise from 65.14 to 66.81 and passed Dawid Kopiczko for seventh. ALbert RUehlman reached 69.31 while remaining sixth, level on score with fifth-place _hans. ARC Raiders remains ninth."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Odd Dice finds forward motion",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "social-2110243114988581038",
        "person-itsu-identity-0"
      ],
      "text": "Odd Dice reaches 28th at 42.08, up 3.05 points and nine places against the edition baseline. Yesterday, its verified account イツ wrote that even a two-and-a-half-point improvement had left it below an earlier 31st place. The newer morning result reverses that immediate frustration, while illustrating the same pressure felt nearer the gold line: progress has to be measured against a moving field. The translated comment is the player’s dated observation, not the baseline for today’s comparison."
    }
  ],
